// _add() (or, for firestore_field_value_reference(), also directly wherever
// a value is expected, e.g. firestore_query_where_equal_to()). GML has no
// int64 or a way to tag a raw real as "this must be a Firestore Timestamp/
// GeoPoint/Reference/Blob/int64" - these constructors are how script code
// opts into that exact typing; a plain real/string/bool/array/struct in a
// data map is otherwise stored as double/string/bool/array/map respectively.

